Name: webrender
Short Name: webrender
URL: https://github.com/servo/webrender
Version: 0.1.0
Revision: e1c924ebad9ffdfe8c8c606aba77eb3f888c396a
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py webrender, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0, MIT/Apache-2.0, MPL-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A mechanism for serializing and deserializing data into/from byte buffers, for use in WebRender.

Local Modifications:
The crates (14) live in third_party/webrender/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/webrender/ unchanged.

Crates:
  compositor 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/compositor
  compositor-wayland 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/compositor-wayland
  compositor-windows 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/compositor-windows
  webrender-examples 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/webrender-examples (not in the workspace)
  glsl-to-cxx 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/glsl-to-cxx
  peek-poke 0.3.0 third_party/webrender/peek-poke
  peek-poke-derive 0.3.0 third_party/webrender/peek-poke-derive
  swgl 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/swgl
  webrender 0.62.0 third_party/webrender/webrender
  webrender_api 0.62.0 third_party/webrender/webrender_api
  webrender_build 0.0.2 third_party/webrender/webrender_build
  wr_glyph_rasterizer 0.1.0 third_party/webrender/wr_glyph_rasterizer
  wr_malloc_size_of 0.0.2 third_party/webrender/wr_malloc_size_of
  wrench 0.3.0 third_party/webrender/wrench (not in the workspace)
